# R-AGENT-PARITY — private agent instructions and generated local indexes.
# Public counterparts: .github/copilot-instructions.md, .github/instructions/
# agent-environment.instructions.md, docs/AGENT-DOC-CATALOG.md, AGENTS.md.
/.github/copilot-instructions.local.md
